        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>怀孕第2个月要做的事</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #f0f0f0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #FFD34D;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .inner {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 18px 16px 10px 16px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  td, th {\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding: 6px 8px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .section-header {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 6px;\n  }\n  .blue-header {\n    background: #DCEEF7;\n  }\n  .yellow-header {\n    background: #FFD34D;\n  }\n  .label-col {\n    background: #fafafa;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    width: 90px;\n  }\n  .center {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .relative-row {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .food-placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 4px;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 78px;\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .content-with-space {\n    padding-right: 100px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"card\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"title\">怀孕第 2 个月要做的事</div>\n\n    <table>\n      <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"section-header blue-header\">孕检</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"center\" style=\"font-weight:bold; background:#fafafa;\">孕周</td>\n        <td class=\"center\" style=\"font-weight:bold; background:#fafafa;\">检查项目</td>\n        <td class=\"center\" style=\"font-weight:bold; background:#fafafa;\">检查目的</td>\n        <td class=\"center\" style=\"font-weight:bold; background:#fafafa;\">注意事项</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"center\">孕 6-9 周</td>\n        <td class=\"center\">抽血</td>\n        <td class=\"center\">看胎心、胎芽</td>\n        <td>不建议太早去，太小不容易检查到，</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"center\">B 超</td>\n        <td class=\"center\">确认宫内孕</td>\n        <td>第一次 B 超建议准爸爸陪同</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"section-header yellow-header\">饮食指南</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label-col\">重要营养</td>\n        <td colspan=\"3\">叶酸、维 B6、C（缓解孕吐，预防妊娠期牙龈炎）</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label-col\">饮食重点</td>\n        <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"center\">少食多餐，饮食均衡</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"4\">①食补：鱼肉、鸡肉、芹菜、南瓜、西红柿、小白菜、草莓、金桔</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr class=\"relative-row\">\n        <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"content-with-space\">\n          ②推荐食谱：番茄鸡蛋面、醋溜白菜、豌豆炒虾仁、清蒸鲈鱼、彩椒炒蒸片、蒜蓉粉丝蒸丝瓜、酸奶水果沙拉、香橙苹果汁\n          <div class=\"food-placeholder\">[Photo: bowl of fruits/vegetables, right side]</div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"4\">③饮食禁忌：不吃保健品如天麻、人参、西洋参、灵芝、胖大海</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"section-header yellow-header\">重点事项</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label-col\">胎儿变化</td>\n        <td colspan=\"3\">心脏有规律地跳动，四肢开始长出，眼鼻清晰可辨</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label-col\">孕妈变化</td>\n        <td colspan=\"3\">子宫增大如鹅蛋大小，阴道分泌物增多，恶心、厌食、呕吐</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"label-col\">注意事项</td>\n        <td colspan=\"3\">\n          ①避免尿路感染，多喝水，勤换内裤，每天用温水冲洗外阴<br>\n          ②可以使用护肤品，不要用功效型产品如美白、祛斑等<br>\n          ③避免用力的动作，不提重物、不干重活<br>\n          ④这个时期可能出现早孕反应身体不适，不擅自用药需遵医嘱\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
